{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There exist positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f642cbbd390b4882363ab6b5c2906dbf6be6cc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, with no <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_common_divisor\" title=\"Greatest common divisor\">common factor</a> greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b4e4f8bbd410fb1af6cbd49b7b9e762b9ea4fd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A \\log_{200} 5 + B \\log_{200} 2 = C.\\]\" width=\"210\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61c5c96b5fc71513978687cb5076d21f4536d05f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B + C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2c9abe6775892917f87713470af6d298bc39a04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 6 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 7 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 8 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 9 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 10 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"353\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b47d934f586a3d9639f0accef2d5b687ca83446.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A \\log_{200} 5 + B \\log_{200} 2 = C\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying and taking the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">logarithms</a> away,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35edebf60a92adc384366ff422a61bba40df6986.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^A \\cdot 2^B=200^C=2^{3C} \\cdot 5^{2C}\\]\" width=\"205\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3f16eb201233fa9b9ad027df9e2859c2ed0126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2C$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d88b0484e9d58944c11c0e47cf444e54b8f7245.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3C$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccf6d387ce491c0ca100c134021f21f616d75162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa25bbf3c89dabbee03da41f11b0f94e8ab90749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c2c9486777b4b59b7f5cf1af4476b219edeff4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1a0a1fba5abcc1686547b4c9754aa25665358a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/0/7e052ba7ba581c9f1854d4638cb7f7200fd0e3c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C=6 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">